  "description": "The Optimizely AI Assistant integrates with Optimizely Content Cloud (CMS) PaaS and Customized Connect Commerce PaaS, allowing you to incorporate your preferred Large Language Models (LLMs) such as OpenAI's GPT-5 or ChatGPT, Azure AI Foundry, Meta's Llama AI, Google's Gemini AI, Anthropic's Claude AI, Writer.com, Recraft AI or any other AI. It also functions perfectly as a real-time translation engine, creates stunning image generations, and generates alt-texts from images.",
